          rel="noopener" data-checkout="250 Aulas Prontas — Oferta Relâmpago" data-sku="250-aulas-relampago"
          data-price="18.90">Quero as 250 Aulas —
          R$18,90</a>
        <a href="https://pay.wiapy.com/LXGERO2qjnZE" class="flash__keep" id="flashKeep" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
          data-checkout="HYROX Master Class" data-sku="master-class" data-price="10.00">Continuar com a Master Class —
          R$10</a>
      </div>
